<title>USA: Electronic says board sets buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Electronic says board sets buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBOROUGH, Mass. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic Designs Inc said Monday its board has approved the repurchase of up to 350,000 shares of its common stock, to be used to meet employee benefit plan requirements and other corporate purposes.</p>
<p>The company said the stock may be purchased from time to time on the open market or in privately-negotiated transactions, depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>The company said it currently has 7,100,929 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
